      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present a patient admitted to our Department for a Tc-99m HDP three-phase bone scintigraphy to evaluate a hip prosthesis. Delayed images showed diffuse myocardial uptake at whole body scan. In such cases, several diseases should be considered in the differential diagnosis."},
